B.JN=new A.O("prints","Prints on the Rolling Pin","",0,"Three sets of prints came up under the powder. Penny Cotta's are all over both handles: it is her rolling pin. Graham Cracker's are on the very tip of one handle. And Colonel Cannoli's are on the marble barrel itself, where the weight is.",B.bl,B.bi,null,B.k,B.c,!1,"churlock")
