B.KW=new A.O("prints","Prints on the Urn","",0,"Three sets of prints came up under the powder. On the lid, Penny Cotta's: she fills it every morning. On the left handle, Tira Misu's. On the right handle, Graham Cracker's.",B.bl,B.bi,null,B.k,B.c,!1,"churlock")
