B.acu=new A.m("chain","Is this link from your monocle chain?","Mine, sir? Count them. Forty links, and not one missing. Mine is a soldier's chain, thick as bootlace. That is a fine little thing. A professional man's chain. A lawyer's. A doctor's.",B.R7,B.c,null)
